diff --git a/samba_dual_user/DOCS.md b/samba_dual_user/DOCS.md
index 36a98fa..69ffbec 100644
--- a/samba_dual_user/DOCS.md
+++ b/samba_dual_user/DOCS.md
@@ -81,6 +81,18 @@ The username you would like to use to authenticate with the Samba server.
 
 The password that goes with the username configured for authentication.
 
+### Option: `ro_username` (optional)
+
+A second account that can read, but never write to or delete from, every enabled
+share (Samba enforces it via `read list`). Useful for automated consumers such as
+backup jobs. Must differ from `username`. Leave empty to disable it; the app then
+behaves exactly like the official Samba share app.
+
+### Option: `ro_password` (optional)
+
+The password that goes with the read-only username. The read-only account is only
+created when both `ro_username` and `ro_password` are set.
+
 ### Option: `workgroup` (required)
 
 Change WORKGROUP to reflect your network needs.
